			"notes": "# 26.3 Update\n\nSooo... I wasn't paying attention, and I didn't realize that Minecraft 26.3 released right as I was gearing up to release CraftUI 1.0. So this update updates CraftUI to 26.3, which it really should have been on in the first place.\n\nThere are no public-facing API changes, although the implementation for sub-viewports has been completely rewritten and should be a little more stable."
		},
